/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (One Fenix customer for the past three years is Ritah Namatovu. She is now able to work at night to support her four grandchildren, thanks to her solar energy kit. Namatovu's only concern is that the solar panel might one day be stolen from her roof. "The solar panel is an asset I now own. There are no blackouts. These panels look so small, but they are powerful," she said.)
/E (One Fenix customer for the past three years is Ritah Namatovu. She is now able to work at night to support her four grandchildren, thanks to her solar energy kit. Namatovu's only concern is that the solar panel might one day be stolen from her roof. "The solar panel is an asset I now own. There are no blackouts. These panels look so small, but they are powerful," she said.)
/Pg 71 0 R
/K [5]
>>
